  "solution": "$a_k=2\\cdot4^{k-1}=2\\cdot2^{2k-2}=2^{2k-1}$이므로\n$$\\sum_{k=1}^{10}\\log_2a_k=\\sum_{k=1}^{10}\\log_22^{2k-1}=\\sum_{k=1}^{10}(2k-1)=2\\cdot\\dfrac{10\\cdot11}{2}-10=100$$\n이다.",
